    },
    {
      "text": "Balance the mixing bowl on top of the pan of boiling water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chocolate-ganache/#wprm-recipe-50609-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-chocolate-ganache-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continually stir the chocolate as it melts, taking care not to let it burn.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chocolate-ganache/#wprm-recipe-50609-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-chocolate-ganache-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the chocolate is melted, add in the heavy whipping cream a little at a time and continue stirring until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chocolate-ganache/#wprm-recipe-50609-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-chocolate-ganache-05.jpg"
